sources/dolly-zh-hant.jsonl

This file is a Traditional Chinese (Taiwan) translation of 1948 instructions
from databricks/databricks-dolly-15k (Hub revision
bdd27f4d94b9c1f951818a7da7fd7aeea5dbff1a, the `instruction` field only).

Licence: CC BY-SA 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/).
The original work is databricks-dolly-15k by Databricks, Inc., licensed
under CC BY-SA 3.0. This translation is an adaptation of that work and is
distributed under the same licence.

Changes: each instruction was machine-translated by an LLM (Claude Haiku),
which was used strictly as a translator. The prompt asked it to translate
faithfully into Taiwan Traditional Chinese and never to answer the
instruction. No instruction was written, rewritten or answered by the LLM.
One selected instruction has no translation (it quotes song lyrics); it is
listed in configs/sources.toml under translation_exclude.

Format: one JSON object per line, {"source_sha256", "text"}. source_sha256 is
the sha256 of the exact English instruction (UTF-8, not normalised). The
English text is not included; the pipeline joins it from the original
dataset. See docs/specs/0003-m1-data-pipeline.md (B12, B13).
